First release.

Spin a two-tone shield around your core and block each incoming orb with the matching colour. Tap to swap which half is which.

Block an orb dead-centre on the correct half for a PERFECT and double points. Chain blocks to climb the multiplier, and every 15 in a row triggers OVERDRIVE: six seconds of wide shield, colour-blind blocking and double score.

Three hits and the run is over. Then it's one tap back in.
